    "algorithm": "Seed commitment: SHA-256(server_seed). Stream: block(i)=HMAC-SHA256(server_seed, \"shards-roll-v1|\"+egg_id+\"|\"+client_seed+\"|\"+i) with i in decimal; words are consecutive 8-byte big-endian values of block(0)||block(1)||...; Uint64n(n) takes the next word w, skips it if w >= 2^64-(2^64 mod n), else returns w mod n. Hatch: if the player's pity target is of the egg's rarity and pity_counter+1 >= the receipt's pity_threshold the species is the target. Otherwise rarity = the tier whose cumulative units exceed Uint64n(total) in table[egg], then species = species[rarity][Uint64n(len)]. Stats, affinity and personality are not part of the stream.",
